{"unit_id":"TwinsEarth__dsh-fang#card-zh","repo":"TwinsEarth/dsh-fang","commit":"4ebca198912dfc15172ccc833197bfc934fbb3ed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-Fang（瓮城）是面向 DSH Web 的隔离开发与会话协作插件。它通过网页侧栏和控制面板管理母体与独立分身，为每个任务派生单独的 DSH Web 环境，并提供状态查看、归档恢复、插件提升、会话目录、实时会话桥接及选取会话同步。适合需要并行开展插件开发、保持母体环境稳定并在多个 DSH 会话间交接工作的用户。需要本机安装 DSH 和 Node.js 22 以上版本；不要求模型 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugins/orchestrator.mjs:430","src/plugins/orchestrator.mjs:1458","client.js:3233","src/plugins/session-bridge.mjs:143","src/plugins/session-sync.mjs:155"]}
{"unit_id":"TwinsEarth__dsh-fang#card-en","repo":"TwinsEarth/dsh-fang","commit":"4ebca198912dfc15172ccc833197bfc934fbb3ed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-Fang is a DSH Web plugin for isolated development. Its sidebar creates task forks and supports status, archive and restore, plugin promotion, session browsing, live bridging, and selected-session transfer. For parallel DSH work; requires local DSH and Node.js 22+. No model API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugins/orchestrator.mjs:430","src/plugins/orchestrator.mjs:1458","client.js:3233","src/plugins/session-bridge.mjs:143","src/plugins/session-sync.mjs:155"]}
